WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.474
Inside fetal echocardiography, anatomy changes with

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:04.782
each

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:08.787
frame. Diagnosing congenital cardiac disease requires

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:12.037
more than recognising a single still image.

00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:18.289
Ultrasound images are sensitive to acquisition and

00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:21.721
annotation. Before modelling, their quality and the

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:25.153
study's sampling conditions need careful attention.

00:00:27.842 --> 00:00:31.143
Convolutional neural networks can extract visual

00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:34.650
patterns. Long short-term memory models can process

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.360
sequence information, when the input design preserves

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:38.570
it.

00:00:41.342 --> 00:00:45.171
Our paper studied stacking-based CNN-LSTM techniques

00:00:45.171 --> 00:00:45.392
for

00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:49.223
fetal echocardiogram interpretation. Evaluating them

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:49.370
is

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.552
different from establishing safe deployment.

00:00:55.383 --> 00:00:59.136
Model accuracy alone cannot settle clinical utility.

00:00:59.136 --> 00:01:02.672
Dataset composition, validation design, and false

00:01:02.672 --> 00:01:06.565
positive or missed cases determine how results should

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:06.712
be

00:01:06.712 --> 00:01:07.073
read.

00:01:10.008 --> 00:01:14.262
The 2023 publication is an exploratory contribution to

00:01:14.262 --> 00:01:18.358
congenital heart disease detection. The source paper

00:01:18.358 --> 00:01:21.666
retains the actual comparisons and limits.
